{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No weapons, no leveling up, no loot, no drama. Escapism for the modern age. Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean) is a simple game where you can live out your secret fantasy of throwing a series of phones into a series of beautiful bodies of water. A meditative experience and cathartic way to deal with our attachment to technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/screen8888.png?t=1748594298\" /></div>\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/PhoneNew_transparent_small.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arcade </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Arcade Mode has a simple scoring system and allows you to get competitive with friends. Toss your phones into a series of objectives as they float down the river, drift by your sea-scape or play some strange carnival games. Featuring a local leaderboard, so you can challenge your friends or get competitive with yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/PhoneNew_transparent_small.png?t=1748594298\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/screen7777.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zen Mode is the ultimate escape. With no objectives or time limit, take a walk through the palm trees on a moonlit tropical shoreline or witness the northern lights among the pines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/screenwde2.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of your rebellious acts in a series of beautiful environments. With none of the environmental hazards of throwing your real phone into real nature! <i>Throw Your Phone</i> is the responsible choice, and the ultimate simple satire simulator.<br><br>Featuring realistic water as the centerpiece around a series of stylized tranquil environments, this game is a digital vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/library_logo_transparent.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2138740?t=1748594298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2138740?t=1748594298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748594298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748594298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No weapons, no leveling up, no loot, no drama. Escapism for the modern age. Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean) is a simple game where you can live out your secret fantasy of throwing a series of phones into a series of beautiful bodies of water. A meditative experience and cathartic way to deal with our attachment to technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/screen8888.png?t=1748594298\" /></div>\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/PhoneNew_transparent_small.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arcade </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Arcade Mode has a simple scoring system and allows you to get competitive with friends. Toss your phones into a series of objectives as they float down the river, drift by your sea-scape or play some strange carnival games. Featuring a local leaderboard, so you can challenge your friends or get competitive with yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/PhoneNew_transparent_small.png?t=1748594298\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/screen7777.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zen Mode is the ultimate escape. With no objectives or time limit, take a walk through the palm trees on a moonlit tropical shoreline or witness the northern lights among the pines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/screenwde2.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of your rebellious acts in a series of beautiful environments. With none of the environmental hazards of throwing your real phone into real nature! <i>Throw Your Phone</i> is the responsible choice, and the ultimate simple satire simulator.<br><br>Featuring realistic water as the centerpiece around a series of stylized tranquil environments, this game is a digital vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/library_logo_transparent.png?t=1748594298\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Billy Laurain"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/header.jpg?t=1748594298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148249,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148249/movie480.mp4?t=1748593994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148249/movie_max.mp4?t=1748593994"},"name":"Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean) - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148249/713b08f134a38625999931e7cbc2cd24ab287bdc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748593994","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148249/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748593994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148249/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748593994"}}],"name":"Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean)","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2380 or equivalent / AMD FX-6100 (6 * 3300) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video Card: NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, requires motion controllers</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sandbar Games (Sandbar Studios, LLC)"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date"